@page "/"
<h3>Welcome to ExpenseCategorizer</h3>

<p class="text-muted">
    Track, categorize, and report your expenses with ease.
    Here’s how to get started:
</p>

<div class="card mt-3">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h5>1. Upload Expense</h5>
        <p>
            Upload receipts, PDFs, images, or JSON files.
            Our OCR + ML pipeline extracts details and converts them into structured expenses.
        </p>
        <a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/upload">Go to Upload</a>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card mt-3">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h5>2. Get All Expenses</h5>
        <p>
            View your expense dashboard with categories, explanations, dates, and amounts.
            Edit or delete entries directly from the table.
        </p>
        <a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/dashboard">View Expenses</a>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card mt-3">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h5>3. Download Monthly Report</h5>
        <p>
            Generate a PDF report of your expenses for the month.
            Perfect for bookkeeping or sharing with clients.
        </p>
        <a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/report">Download Report</a>
    </div>
</div>
